      answer: "d",
      explanation: "Blood-to-tubular-lumen transfer at the tubular epithelium is secretion. Reabsorption goes in the opposite net direction, and filtration occurs across the glomerular barrier into Bowman's space. Ureteric peristalsis moves urine after renal processing.",
